#Selectors --
    Selectors are used for select the HTML elements.
    Types of Selectors -----
    1. Simple Selectors
        1.Universal Selectors(*)
        2.Class Slectors(.)
        3.Id Selectors (#)
        4.Tag Selectors
    2. Combination Selectors
        1.tag #
        2.#outer .
        3.. #
        4. tag.#
    3. Pseudo Class Selectors
        Ex- :hover , :marker , .visited , unvisited , etc.
    4. Pseudo Elements Selectors
        Ex - ::after, ::before ,etc.
    5. Combinator Selectors
        ~ , +
